% Anaphoric noun phrases without a head noun (Browne's, three, one anaphora)
% introduce 'generic_entity', a cue that anaphora resolution is required.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_ImplicitNominals/):
%   generic_entity[ARG0 x]

pattern { G [pred="generic_entity"] }
